{"path":"eval/cases/cigster-118/sources/review-comments.json","ref":"a610a8c226a46a202300b570b1519382fa6a92cd","side":"new","lines":[{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":1,"text":"["},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":2,"text":"  {"},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":3,"text":"    \"html_url\": \"https://github.com/matemolnar8/cigster/pull/118#discussion_r3940885603\","},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":4,"text":"    \"user\": {"},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":5,"text":"      \"login\": \"cursor[bot]\""},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":6,"text":"    },"},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":7,"text":"    \"body\": \"### Join codes leak into PostHog events\\n\\n**Medium Severity**\\n\\n<!-- DESCRIPTION START -->\\n`sanitizeCaptureEvent` rewrites URL and path properties and drops `data-code`, but it never scrubs `$title`, `$prev_pageview_title`, or autocapture `$el_text` / `$elements` text. The player route title embeds the join code, and the host copy-link control still renders the raw join URL without `ph-no-capture` (`JoinCodeBadge` is also unprotected). Every `/game/$code` pageview and those clicks therefore send the live code as event properties, which this change set out to prevent.\\n<!-- DESCRIPTION END -->\\n\\n<!-- BUGBOT_BUG_ID: 578227b4-4c43-4476-bcf7-56729885e234 -->\\n\\n<!-- LOCATIONS START\\nsrc/lib/analytics/posthog.ts#L54-L96\\nsrc/components/game/HostLobby.tsx#L81-L103\\nsrc/routes/game/$code.tsx#L20-L25\\nLOCATIONS END -->\\n<details>\\n<summary>Additional Locations (2)</summary>\\n\\n- [`src/components/game/HostLobby.tsx#L81-L103`](https://github.com/matemolnar8/cigster/blob/826d5be2b223ba79b3bd4888bd68ebffaaf47623/src/components/game/HostLobby.tsx#L81-L103)\\n- [`src/routes/game/$code.tsx#L20-L25`](https://github.com/matemolnar8/cigster/blob/826d5be2b223ba79b3bd4888bd68ebffaaf47623/src/routes/game/$code.tsx#L20-L25)\\n\\n</details>\\n\\n<div><a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/open?\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Fix in Cursor\\\" width=\\\"115\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/agents?\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Fix in Web\\\" width=\\\"99\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\\\"></picture></a></div>\\n\\n\\n<sup>Reviewed by [Cursor Bugbot](https://cursor.com/bugbot) for commit 826d5be2b223ba79b3bd4888bd68ebffaaf47623. Configure [here](https://www.cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot).</sup>\\n\","},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":8,"text":"    \"path\": \"src/lib/analytics/posthog.ts\","},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":9,"text":"    \"side\": \"RIGHT\","},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":10,"text":"    \"line\": 136,"},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":11,"text":"    \"original_line\": 96,"},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":12,"text":"    \"original_commit_id\": \"826d5be2b223ba79b3bd4888bd68ebffaaf47623\","},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":13,"text":"    \"commit_id\": \"a4f4143110d027c74a159b2bb2fa7750efbd5560\""},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":14,"text":"  },"},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":15,"text":"  {"},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":16,"text":"    \"html_url\": \"https://github.com/matemolnar8/cigster/pull/118#discussion_r3940912992\","},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":17,"text":"    \"user\": {"},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":18,"text":"      \"login\": \"matemolnar8\""},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":19,"text":"    },"},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":20,"text":"    \"body\": \"Fixed in 7218fca. `before_send` now redacts live route params in `$title`, `$el_text`, and related strings (`Game ABC12` → `Game $code`). The host copy-link control and `JoinCodeBadge` are `ph-no-capture`. Also stopped exporting `sanitizeCaptureEvent` so knip is clean.\\n\\nPosted by Cursor Grok 4.6\","},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":21,"text":"    \"path\": \"src/lib/analytics/posthog.ts\","},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":22,"text":"    \"side\": \"RIGHT\","},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":23,"text":"    \"line\": 136,"},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":24,"text":"    \"original_line\": 96,"},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":25,"text":"    \"original_commit_id\": \"826d5be2b223ba79b3bd4888bd68ebffaaf47623\","},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":26,"text":"    \"commit_id\": \"a4f4143110d027c74a159b2bb2fa7750efbd5560\""},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":27,"text":"  },"},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":28,"text":"  {"},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":29,"text":"    \"html_url\": \"https://github.com/matemolnar8/cigster/pull/118#discussion_r3940927138\","},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":30,"text":"    \"user\": {"},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":31,"text":"      \"login\": \"cursor[bot]\""},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":32,"text":"    },"},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":33,"text":"    \"body\": \"### Join codes leak on host routes\\n\\n**Medium Severity**\\n\\n<!-- DESCRIPTION START -->\\n`redactText` only substitutes params found in known pathnames, so a bare join code on `/game/host/$gameId` or `/game/tv/$gameId` is left intact. Autocapture still walks ancestors, and those nodes' `$el_text` / `$elements_chain` include the lobby code. `ph-no-capture` on the code node does not strip that ancestor text, so join codes can still reach PostHog.\\n<!-- DESCRIPTION END -->\\n\\n<!-- BUGBOT_BUG_ID: c52861b7-f585-4135-8458-86a01e37fa85 -->\\n\\n<!-- LOCATIONS START\\nsrc/lib/analytics/posthog.ts#L71-L77\\nsrc/lib/analytics/routeTemplate.ts#L44-L59\\nLOCATIONS END -->\\n<details>\\n<summary>Additional Locations (1)</summary>\\n\\n- [`src/lib/analytics/routeTemplate.ts#L44-L59`](https://github.com/matemolnar8/cigster/blob/7218fcaf160cb89e3234f6d247cafaddf9941948/src/lib/analytics/routeTemplate.ts#L44-L59)\\n\\n</details>\\n\\n<div><a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/open?\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Fix in Cursor\\\" width=\\\"115\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/agents?\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Fix in Web\\\" width=\\\"99\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\\\"></picture></a></div>\\n\\n\\n<sup>Reviewed by [Cursor Bugbot](https://cursor.com/bugbot) for commit 7218fcaf160cb89e3234f6d247cafaddf9941948. Configure [here](https://www.cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot).</sup>\\n\","},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":34,"text":"    \"path\": \"src/lib/analytics/posthog.ts\","},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":35,"text":"    \"side\": \"RIGHT\","},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":36,"text":"    \"line\": null,"},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":37,"text":"    \"original_line\": 77,"},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":38,"text":"    \"original_commit_id\": \"7218fcaf160cb89e3234f6d247cafaddf9941948\","},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":39,"text":"    \"commit_id\": \"7218fcaf160cb89e3234f6d247cafaddf9941948\""},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":40,"text":"  },"},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":41,"text":"  {"},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":42,"text":"    \"html_url\": \"https://github.com/matemolnar8/cigster/pull/118#discussion_r3940935112\","},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":43,"text":"    \"user\": {"},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":44,"text":"      \"login\": \"matemolnar8\""},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":45,"text":"    },"},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":46,"text":"    \"body\": \"Fixed in a4f4143. Host/TV pathnames do not include the join code, so `before_send` now also replaces six-character join-code t